  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.29-beta: Added symbology parameter support (stype_in/stype_out) to GetRangeAsync and GetRangeToFileAsync. Enables filtering by instrument type using parent symbology (e.g., ES.FUT for all E-mini S&P 500 futures, QQQ.OPT for all QQQ options). Non-breaking change - new overloads added.",
